#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da7b22b19962997e3de5ad0bd410125e43c7162e9128a8b60b83c26fc0d016f5
#. default-sha256: ff35b8330001694f8f3eba73fc13045d9330712c16aaad7a529317b07437febe
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫我本来想——⟪k:14⟫否定的。"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫我本来想——⟪k:14⟫否定的。"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b30b0730121adb9211bb67e1de256e211b9f533bd303e134d4ab48e9d67f14b
#. default-sha256: b3daf7af2a695babcd861211c132726d26e0176908639db6a013c6c62f5d2b75
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:2"
msgid "比如，⟪k:0⟫即使是忘记了关于我的事情——⟪k:1⟫正因为怀有对我的思念，⟪k:2⟫她需要的正是，"
msgstr "比如，⟪k:0⟫即使是忘记了关于我的事情——⟪k:1⟫正因为怀有对我的思念，⟪k:2⟫她需要的正是，"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4029e7ea155cdaf34b31c4499d04d58397955e2cbdff8c4a30c54ceaf238264f
#. default-sha256: 4850c2004006a484f60946f08a350fdb9648f550263c4dfd9b0e2ba3606d80ed
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:3"
msgid "跟我有同样特征的白发少女。"
msgstr "跟我有同样特征的白发少女。"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de267910dc25a34958b76830157626a3a020dc93b3227d07bbebc2ad7a7314e6
#. default-sha256: 1fef4427044055eeae8045e45126f4e0ca5f4b9c5b92ded555f568b35e6e61cd
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫她还怀有对我的思念。⟪k:1⟫我这样相信着，⟪k:2⟫可是——"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫她还怀有对我的思念。⟪k:1⟫我这样相信着，⟪k:2⟫可是——"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7ef97d0a289fa95a663390db8160045d59591a922ecc06d63f5b2759de46ff6
#. default-sha256: 3695769133f630269e92eb6e2c1de41f707874176e936dcfa5f372efbe1b4bc2
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:5"
msgid ""
"看着她冰冷的双瞳，⟪k:0⟫我产生了一瞬间的迷惑。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫一个想法从我脑海中闪过，⟪k:3⟫我的否定或许只"
"是我单方面的愿望——"
msgstr ""
"看着她冰冷的双瞳，⟪k:0⟫我产生了一瞬间的迷惑。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫一个想法从我脑海中闪过，⟪k:3⟫我的否定或许只"
"是我单方面的愿望——"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0519618da7931aaa1e5801bf55e6edf82b173da90bd5342b71baa122b5e5d141
#. default-sha256: 36cfbb929bb5ef50e5cb3e013559c4e2555f0925b92898378d4ab610a20fdc37
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:6"
msgid "不过数秒的时间，⟪k:0⟫只不过，⟪k:1⟫一瞬间而已。"
msgstr "不过数秒的时间，⟪k:0⟫只不过，⟪k:1⟫一瞬间而已。"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 932a2327c6ada9a1bc023cb798509851ab19de8bae237260ccf65ee86ac7d1ee
#. default-sha256: c1f2cce57749158349e0193199da43abf9ae35a07bf54e35877a11051833aa14
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:7"
msgid "在那个瞬间，一切都被决定了。"
msgstr "在那个瞬间，一切都被决定了。"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3683115aad66547c82d44e564a0d1896547e7f4f6eb4e1250bcf5fd01ee1a300
#. default-sha256: 1540df27a7df70a12205b708b1641fa26f363bb1000df84be02a345dd6029956
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:8"
msgid "………永别了，⟪k:0⟫米歇尔。"
msgstr "………永别了，⟪k:0⟫米歇尔。"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32543bf37f6800f2d76601213385182994e14e6dfebe6e6f67c7c652f73621f4
#. default-sha256: 8f4b0fb27faf920611f5f5d31b6432730e4f7dc921e48d2238e6d888aea1208e
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:9"
msgid "她用纤细的指尖，⟪k:0⟫轻轻地抚摸着我的喉咙——然后，⟪k:1⟫把我推开了。"
msgstr "她用纤细的指尖，⟪k:0⟫轻轻地抚摸着我的喉咙——然后，⟪k:1⟫把我推开了。"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:10
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9703a8fac59c950a89d63e2ab75ad46e05bfa92891f7458346f61e1f7208410
#. default-sha256: 7859d017f18c0fe83f4761f99fa053596b363ed338d3cae37a95d6b273f5c9df
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:10"
msgid "……吉⟪k:0⟫……赛尔……！"
msgstr "……吉⟪k:0⟫……赛尔……！"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 599464cb4ac6c83abf170f072e0a938c205710a0d4bba40c474731a9a81fa21d
#. default-sha256: e5b7a0e41917565699e4a935c4c3bc63693e6193598af2ee6a989994bcc614cb
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:11"
msgid "坠落。"
msgstr "坠落。"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e71fcc172bedeb1c8f137b46e10d12dea2a99208d087eaa3f6bfb402abfb71e7
#. default-sha256: f6e09f695067685a834dccef1da55facce3c7aa11ef8984e07bf6e9cf870b5bd
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:12"
msgid "我只身一人，⟪k:0⟫向黑暗中坠落。"
msgstr "我只身一人，⟪k:0⟫向黑暗中坠落。"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f750d5b4c79505d9e0ef08ac7a589cfc84f014446cc7e98cff366e6ffcaf8be
#. default-sha256: 8f4de4559fbc285fcc91a74e65cedf54831ed80de2e10c8cd359b44fe821df81
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:13"
msgid "即便伸出手，⟪k:0⟫也触及不到。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫曾经，⟪k:3⟫一直一直握着的她的手——已经如此、遥远。"
msgstr "即便伸出手，⟪k:0⟫也触及不到。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫曾经，⟪k:3⟫一直一直握着的她的手——已经如此、遥远。"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 574a6c0e9c1b0971a88daa8381fed89f7889f9784796e9d696951cd722cccb77
#. default-sha256: 64bbd6e65662371b98093561ddea15a45ca285f73e13e5285a63b4e4551d825f
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:14"
msgid "即使张开嘴想要呼叫，⟪k:0⟫也发不出声音。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫说出一句否定的话，⟪k:3⟫就连呼唤她的名字也——"
msgstr ""
"即使张开嘴想要呼叫，⟪k:0⟫也发不出声音。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫说出一句否定的话，⟪k:3⟫就连呼唤她的名字也——"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:15
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa11f04450f48933b9c7678a0d55f89ca69a7b6402f15b45419d84dd8cfb09fe
#. default-sha256: 0bbaa3cbba2e078f7ad66322684c7333eacda6b472c96eff03653dee04d448ae
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:15"
msgid "做不到。"
msgstr "做不到。"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 378f85d8bb8b973b471a8ee90504d846acd384eef137d984c088f363e60efe17
#. default-sha256: 53b4fa0aef958da6d5c913671af53e1d167bec52443cd7f9875260c74409f742
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:16"
msgid "……坠落下去……"
msgstr "……坠落下去……"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:17
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e6378f43ef2490cd38e2d22fcd894076da02154c710e824e67cb831b8e1737d
#. default-sha256: e23ebcccba95579d5e7e83959fe6d72eaee5ed0ebccb6bcb067c59fdfc649504
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:17"
msgid "坠向那什么都不能看见的黑暗之中……"
msgstr "坠向那什么都不能看见的黑暗之中……"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:18
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9fb8867a62f68f0f70a7b2fa3e91e78bdcffb2a902e70f9bdeeec05324dc56b1
#. default-sha256: 96829123f6f9ce864d507ead7bbc4287059823599b8db7b2935c62a847071c11
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:18"
msgid ""
"所有的一切，⟪k:0⟫都被黑暗吞噬殆尽。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫我的声音，⟪k:3⟫我的双手，⟪k:4⟫我的存在——⟪k:5⟫然后是她"
"的眼神。"
msgstr ""
"所有的一切，⟪k:0⟫都被黑暗吞噬殆尽。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫我的声音，⟪k:3⟫我的双手，⟪k:4⟫我的存在——⟪k:5⟫然后是她"
"的眼神。"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf5d1d7a82722cbdce9c0232bce66e53cb5e91a5ab441aef8e071fdee2592f2b
#. default-sha256: 514f91738a9a75a84cecb5685f9f1264e3cd39044878a5d6fcf1dcdfb8b223fd
msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:19"
msgid "意识，⟪k:0⟫渐渐远去。"
msgstr "意识，⟪k:0⟫渐渐远去。"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:20
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7db7e7024c8d3bdf29491e67d73150dcf305fccdc8c91a5afff321bc6f1f5f35
