msgstr "⟪k:0⟫告诉你"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a9efa76426ac5cfded44cf6f6bdc91c936aba64f2ace1f910475ec4370eecd5
