msgstr "⟪k:0⟫喜欢着你"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:26
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0e6e54d309cba1c27c8ccc6eab12a9a909d1d3339b4b7c4900a740cfefa12f9
