msgctxt "badend4:unlabelled:badend4:30"
msgid "……把他从这座馆中解放。⟪k:0⟫这样真的好吗？"
msgstr "……把他从这座馆中解放。⟪k:0⟫这样真的好吗？"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:31
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af389a611feae9b1ad9cd22c6f8ef95905955233de696b8eda690edbd2fe1066
